---
// Recognition.astro: two recognitions, worded exactly as the claims register
// allows. Programme selection and an incubation offer; neither is an
// endorsement or a customer relationship.
---
<section class="section rec on-navy-hatch" id="recognition" aria-labelledby="rec-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-head section-head--split">
      <p class="eyebrow">03 · Recognition</p>
      <h2 id="rec-title" class="h2">One selection and one offer, <em>worded exactly.</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">We quote these as they are written on the paper, and we do not round them up.</p>
    </header>

    <ul role="list" class="rec__grid rv-stagger" data-inview>
      <li class="rec__plate">
        <p class="rec__k mono">GIFT IFIH · 2026</p>
        <p class="rec__t">Selected in the Top 15 of the GIFT IFIH Young Builders’ Program Hackathon 2026 and in the eight-week residency at GIFT City (Sep to Oct 2026).</p>
        <span class="stamp rec__stamp">Selected</span>
      </li>
      <li class="rec__plate">
        <p class="rec__k mono">IITGN IIEC</p>
        <p class="rec__t">Kriseva was offered incubation by IITGN IIEC.</p>
        <span class="stamp rec__stamp">Offered</span>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="rec__note">Programme recognition and an offer of incubation. Neither is an endorsement by a government body, and neither is a customer relationship. <a href="/proof">See the dated record <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .rec__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(0.85rem, 1.8vw, 1.25rem);
  }

  .rec__plate {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    align-content: start;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.4rem, 1rem + 1.4vw, 2.2rem) clamp(1.4rem, 1rem + 1.4vw, 2.2rem) 4.2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-navy);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 3%);
  }

  .rec__k {
    color: var(--brass-light);
  }

  .rec__t {
    font-family: var(--f-serif);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 1.05rem + 1vw, 1.85rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--on-navy);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .rec__stamp {
    position: absolute;
    right: 1.4rem;
    bottom: 1.3rem;
  }

  .rec__note {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    max-width: 52rem;
    font-size: var(--t-small);
    color: var(--on-navy-2);
  }

  .rec__note a {
    color: var(--on-navy);
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @media (width <= 860px) {
    .rec__grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
